// The node-site marker sheet of the Paths layer (docs/adr/ADR-042 P2). NodeSites reads these indices (gid minus the set's first gid):
// 9 to 11 trees, 13 to 15 weeds, 16 and 17 stones, 18 a twig, 22 grass, 24 to 26 forage spots. The layer is logic only, so no traits.
name Paths
image markers.png
tilewidth 16
tileheight 16
columns 16
tilecount 27
